{
"file": 13,
"paths": [
"d002/f605"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "4b46b887",
"en_raw": "...The Shin-Oji Line curse?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "864ea4a4",
"en_raw": "Sango, you don't know?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "032a69f7",
"en_raw": "I thought it was a pretty famous story"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "d1094a1c",
"en_raw": "Kurumi heard it"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "04f4f988",
"en_raw": "About the place where the black things are"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "cc61d966",
"en_raw": "Under the train..."
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "2be396c5",
"en_raw": "They're increasing, you know"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "a6885236",
"en_raw": "So it seems"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "b1a48480",
"en_raw": "The underpass west of Hirumi Station too"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "b8083b30",
"en_raw": "is connected to the Shin-Oji Line"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "60105249",
"en_raw": "curse, apparently"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "ccfe51e4",
"en_raw": "That place is creepy anyway"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "2c537660",
"en_raw": "and there was a traffic accident"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "3addac74",
"en_raw": "there just the other day"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "bee9c544",
"en_raw": "Stop connecting everything"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "8bc78e57",
"en_raw": "and overthinking it"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "1e2554ea",
"en_raw": "But Kurumi knows"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "2933d815",
"en_raw": "there are black things, weird things"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "2be396c5",
"en_raw": "They're increasing, you know"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "463282ad",
"en_raw": "Hmm, so?"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "faa0748f",
"en_raw": "Well, the Toilet people"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "67aac45b",
"en_raw": "say there's nothing like that"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "076d8a33",
"en_raw": "Naturally"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "a79d5ad9",
"en_raw": "What's there is... right, right"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "0d03a6f3",
"en_raw": "11 people, spirits, they say"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "f3aa6294",
"en_raw": "...11 spirits?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "2753ba09",
"en_raw": "Again? That fake psychic girl"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "728e4223",
"en_raw": "You don't believe it at all, Sango?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "3757e4dc",
"en_raw": "Do you believe it, Nao?"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "6e252fc3",
"en_raw": "...Fine"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "2d3feb7f",
"en_raw": "Then let's do this"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "5fac2803",
"en_raw": "First, one person goes as a representative"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "72cc48c0",
"en_raw": "and walks through that underpass"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "7532788b",
"en_raw": "If anything happens"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "32eea3e0",
"en_raw": "then we all go check it out"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "82374b13",
"en_raw": "What if... there really are spirits?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "46f0fdcd",
"en_raw": "You get scared, scared, and then"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "631c945f",
"en_raw": "you think you see something weird"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "26003652",
"en_raw": "This time, I'll prove"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "600d2890",
"en_raw": "that for you"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "3995bb26",
"en_raw": "Kurumi doesn't want to go in"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "d3c459d3",
"en_raw": "there today"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "10be6682",
"en_raw": "The rules are simple"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "d52697d4",
"en_raw": "As the fake psychic girl said"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "3873ab76",
"en_raw": "just go from the north exit to the south"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "36e32686",
"en_raw": "How long is that underpass,"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "fe260c03",
"en_raw": "about how many meters, I wonder"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "b11b2eb4",
"en_raw": "You can guess by the number of tracks, right?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "5dab97b8",
"en_raw": "It's less than 30 m, I tell you"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "cc94bcdf",
"en_raw": "I guess..."
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "f7bc6a34",
"en_raw": "I felt it was much longer"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "8eedb357",
"en_raw": "...In fact, lately"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "c73e3df1",
"en_raw": "it's gradually getting longer"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "aca58f8e",
"en_raw": "the noise"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "f350ceee",
"en_raw": "Kurumi thinks that place"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "a3dd68c5",
"en_raw": "has been getting bigger too"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "f0b529ab",
"en_raw": "That's your imagination"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "9acc5445",
"en_raw": "What are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "1cf0106f",
"en_raw": "I'll be killed..."
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "677c911b",
"en_raw": "I'll definitely be killed..."
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "aa66229a",
"en_raw": "Th-there's definitely"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "4103d33c",
"en_raw": "something there..."
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "da256eca",
"en_raw": "Calm down"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "eaf9233c",
"en_raw": "Did 11 spirits really show up?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "cdc14981",
"en_raw": "I didn't see them, but"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "deda4b4a",
"en_raw": "I felt it"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "55fe62c8",
"en_raw": "How should I put it, that was..."
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "f546b1a0",
"en_raw": "A feeling of being killed..."
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "6ff389ac",
"en_raw": "Killed?"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "bbe431db",
"en_raw": "Yes, the dead are lonely"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "7c2a58ae",
"en_raw": "so they call for a new accident..."
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "64f7530e",
"en_raw": "they call people from this side"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "114f1967",
"en_raw": "Huh...?"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "17a9400d",
"en_raw": "Sango doesn't believe it!"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "d995f1f4",
"en_raw": "Okay, fine"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "4c4b8416",
"en_raw": "If you insist, change of plan"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "f90473d2",
"en_raw": "This time I'll go alone"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "b7387dba",
"en_raw": "I'll go check whether I really"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "657b99da",
"en_raw": "get killed"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "e754406a",
"en_raw": "You'd better not"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "bf093da7",
"en_raw": "Going to that underpass alone"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "2ecd7784",
"en_raw": "Shiina, stop her too"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "dd08ca3a",
"en_raw": "Sango, that place"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "fec40934",
"en_raw": "has black things"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "fa99da03",
"en_raw": "If I say all this and"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "3d6919b3",
"en_raw": "nothing happens at all,"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "a62040b7",
"en_raw": "what will you guys do?"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "9036e405",
"en_raw": "What's wrong, Sango?"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "5547fea6",
"en_raw": "Are you feeling sick?"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "b9ae5ec8",
"en_raw": "I'm not sick, I'm in a bad mood"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "7442c0d5",
"en_raw": "Did something happen under the tracks?"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "5fc57547",
"en_raw": "Nothing"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "ab77f5da",
"en_raw": "That's why I'm pissed off"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "6f4d76f8",
"en_raw": "What's wrong?"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "b6de2a76",
"en_raw": "11 spirits is a complete lie"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "5c3b21ef",
"en_raw": "Rumors, trends"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "6063cabd",
"en_raw": "making fools of people..."
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "373a0927",
"en_raw": "and on top of that, swept up by desire..."
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "df9d6a91",
"en_raw": "In this world, kids and adults alike"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "b9529b70",
"en_raw": "are rotting away one after another"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "677d5cda",
"en_raw": "Ha ha, you're again"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "29dcab42",
"en_raw": "saying extreme things"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "a86d62fb",
"en_raw": "...Did I say"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "875d4b40",
"en_raw": "something funny?"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "3b6187d7",
"en_raw": "Because..."
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "63a9e8aa",
"en_raw": "I'm not joking"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "9423c65d",
"en_raw": "around!"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "0dd7b19e",
"en_raw": "Sorry, my bad..."
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "e8672579",
"en_raw": "So, about the underpass?"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "794c309a",
"en_raw": "I've had enough"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "2968cd4c",
"en_raw": "If you say scary things"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "da2baa85",
"en_raw": "really exist"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "71e3ef1c",
"en_raw": "Nao, why don't you confirm it?"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "7b55f847",
"en_raw": "I go alone?"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "ace28de2",
"en_raw": "You believe it, right?"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "2b05a40b",
"en_raw": "That silly rumor"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "022c9714",
"en_raw": "Then go see it"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "2acd74e0",
"en_raw": "with your own eyes properly"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "bcc95b50",
"en_raw": "Conclusion: nothing there"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "6459dda5",
"en_raw": "The bad feeling was real, though"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "18a8214a",
"en_raw": "That's just because you're"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "7f39742b",
"en_raw": "a wimp, Nao"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "771f9015",
"en_raw": "...Listen"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "d5d57d1d",
"en_raw": "What's with that look?"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "0eba4576",
"en_raw": "That's not like you"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "f747a9bc",
"en_raw": "...I've always thought this"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "b59d29e5",
"en_raw": "Today I'll say it plainly"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "9e7fe8fa",
"en_raw": "What?"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "05fa73ec",
"en_raw": "Sango, why do you"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "4ed40c4a",
"en_raw": "decide on your own that what people say is a lie?"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "8f425037",
"en_raw": "It's not on my own!"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "e0804cef",
"en_raw": "I judged it with my own eyes"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "46950de7",
"en_raw": "So everyone talking about this underpass"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "e74b99b9",
"en_raw": "is a liar?"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "b71a2bdd",
"en_raw": "Even Shiina and I"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "e71eaf8f",
"en_raw": "get talked about by others"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "e759d58b",
"en_raw": "true or not"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "dbdf6a71",
"en_raw": "just like this underpass"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "b6f5c7e1",
"en_raw": "Nobody says that about me"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "c9ed56a3",
"en_raw": "I'm different from you, Sango"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "32a93144",
"en_raw": "You just happened to be"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "30d302d1",
"en_raw": "good at hiding"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "1ef13331",
"en_raw": "See, that right there"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "f25d1cbf",
"en_raw": "proves you're a wimp!"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "f78669bb",
"en_raw": "...Those who get talked about"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "b12f2dd8",
"en_raw": "have reasons too!"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "79d66d9b",
"en_raw": "The feelings of people who badmouth Sango"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "5540c191",
"en_raw": "I understand them well now"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "0d3dc1ea",
"en_raw": "So what, then!"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "80597288",
"en_raw": "You're saying that people who badmouth"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "73e54d0a",
"en_raw": "Shiina and me are right?"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "9d346c25",
"en_raw": "Is that what you're saying?"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "de9aa413",
"en_raw": "I think so!"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "b507e156",
"en_raw": "...The worst!"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "21095418",
"en_raw": "...I'm disgusted with this guy"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "049404de",
"en_raw": "Putting aside your own weakness"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "a90e4298",
"en_raw": "how can you say that about people?"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "80759f81",
"en_raw": "...Kurumi will go"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "3536477e",
"en_raw": "What, all of a sudden!"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "2bf51971",
"en_raw": "Shiina, be quiet"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "5e784399",
"en_raw": "No, Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "77b029ac",
"en_raw": "will go and get it back"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "426ab3dd",
"en_raw": "More nonsense!"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "d24e210e",
"en_raw": "I'm getting it back"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "bf1850be",
"en_raw": "Nao and Sango"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "a75aea4a",
"en_raw": "What are you talking about, Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "bf1850be",
"en_raw": "Nao and Sango"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "e78acf90",
"en_raw": "They got taken"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "c966c7e5",
"en_raw": "That's why you fight"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "d9bcefee",
"en_raw": "We're not fighting!"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "78fbeb90",
"en_raw": "I'm giving him educational guidance"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "196e6b51",
"en_raw": "No good, I'm getting it back"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "173e5354",
"en_raw": "It's no good like this"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "b24ef1e6",
"en_raw": "..."
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "700ffb1c",
"en_raw": "Kurumi will go"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "2f281842",
"en_raw": "and get it back"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "99873521",
"en_raw": "So what do you mean get back,"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "d1c25caf",
"en_raw": "what is it?"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "a44cddc0",
"en_raw": "I'll meet the black thing under the train"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "9e7a495f",
"en_raw": "and get it back"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "8689d5bd",
"en_raw": "Then everyone will be friends again"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "a1dc7e18",
"en_raw": "It's too late for me"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "c4388858",
"en_raw": "I can't be with this guy"
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "d577d1b2",
"en_raw": "Same here, I don't want to"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "a3476afa",
"en_raw": "talk to Sango anymore"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "14102611",
"en_raw": "Just as we were about to go home"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "9c4e7032",
"en_raw": "the station area was noisy"
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "2364be9d",
"en_raw": "so I went to see what it was"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "ea1d07f7",
"en_raw": "...Another jumper, they said"
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "50220dd4",
"en_raw": "I kind of wondered too"
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "a98d0e1c",
"en_raw": "if it had something to do"
},
{
"n": 194,
"h": "e2356890",
"en_raw": "with Shiina..."
},
{
"n": 195,
"h": "e85b3312",
"en_raw": "No, Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 196,
"h": "02d5c92d",
"en_raw": "is totally fine"
},
{
"n": 197,
"h": "c9c1fae6",
"en_raw": "So, how was it?"
},
{
"n": 198,
"h": "68f1ca20",
"en_raw": "Huh?"
},
{
"n": 199,
"h": "015e262b",
"en_raw": "I mean, you said something about"
},
{
"n": 200,
"h": "9e3df7af",
"en_raw": "getting it back, or whatever"
},
{
"n": 201,
"h": "81cd7982",
"en_raw": "Yeah, right"
},
{
"n": 202,
"h": "5c1701d8",
"en_raw": "There was a big face"
},
{
"n": 203,
"h": "df6dd03f",
"en_raw": "...A big face?"
},
{
"n": 204,
"h": "686522ed",
"en_raw": "Nao, did you see anything like that?"
},
{
"n": 205,
"h": "30e98c51",
"en_raw": "No, I probably didn't"
},
{
"n": 206,
"h": "e7dcf639",
"en_raw": "Shiina, is that true?"
},
{
"n": 207,
"h": "2d894b47",
"en_raw": "At least there were no 11 spirits"
},
{
"n": 208,
"h": "912176b0",
"en_raw": "or black things, were there?"
},
{
"n": 209,
"h": "0ec2af0a",
"en_raw": "It watches from above"
},
{
"n": 210,
"h": "94fdde69",
"en_raw": "...From above?"
},
{
"n": 211,
"h": "234c07bc",
"en_raw": "It watches from above"
},
{
"n": 212,
"h": "85570935",
"en_raw": "and takes all sorts of things"
},
{
"n": 213,
"h": "041b8786",
"en_raw": "It keeps watching forever"
},
{
"n": 214,
"h": "4645539a",
"en_raw": "The ceiling of the underpass"
},
{
"n": 215,
"h": "b441fa2f",
"en_raw": "done anything wrong"
},
{
"n": 216,
"h": "9845396f",
"en_raw": "Hmm, well, fine"
},
{
"n": 217,
"h": "ee8981ad",
"en_raw": "Then as we first promised"
},
{
"n": 218,
"h": "5bd33996",
"en_raw": "shall the three of us go?"
},
{
"n": 219,
"h": "98ac2ca5",
"en_raw": "But Kurumi is done"
},
{
"n": 220,
"h": "4645539a",
"en_raw": "The ceiling of the underpass"
},
{
"n": 221,
"h": "b441fa2f",
"en_raw": "done anything wrong"
},
{
"n": 222,
"h": "9845396f",
"en_raw": "Hmm, well, fine"
},
{
"n": 223,
"h": "ee8981ad",
"en_raw": "Then as we first promised"
},
{
"n": 224,
"h": "5bd33996",
