{
"n": 268,
"h": "e7c41666",
"en_raw": "piled up somewhere"
},
{
"n": 269,
"h": "1bea7560",
"en_raw": "it wouldn't be unnatural"
},
{
"n": 270,
"h": "c32054c8",
"en_raw": "And that strain"
},
{
"n": 271,
"h": "40bafc92",
"en_raw": "is that scary underpass?"
},
{
"n": 272,
"h": "3c3d8d14",
"en_raw": "It's just a bold guess"
},
{
"n": 273,
"h": "07b749f2",
"en_raw": "Shiina, what do you think?"
},
{
"n": 274,
"h": "c53421bd",
"en_raw": "Kurumi, you see, with Melos"
},
{
"n": 275,
"h": "996d9a07",
"en_raw": "Sango and Nao"
},
{
"n": 276,
"h": "6d77402b",
"en_raw": "if we can go to all kinds of places"
},
{
"n": 277,
"h": "c17a4fdb",
"en_raw": "she gets so happy"
},
{
"n": 278,
"h": "8db949d0",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Shin-Oji Line Curse"
},
{
"n": 279,
"h": "0606f639",
"en_raw": "The underpass in question"
},
{
"n": 280,
"h": "7f7a9dcf",
"en_raw": "is set to be demolished this November"
},
{
"n": 281,
"h": "b2aba2f9",
"en_raw": "and renovated, it seems"
},
{
"n": 282,
"h": "89f810cf",
"en_raw": "Even if you ask adults why"
},
{
"n": 283,
"h": "d0535d67",
"en_raw": "nobody tells you"
},
{
"n": 284,
"h": "8bb707ed",
"en_raw": "anything at all"
},
{
"n": 285,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
